WEBVTT

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:31.085
and don't have balance sheet problems,

00:19:31.109 --> 00:19:33.307
in other words,
they have strong balance sheets

00:19:33.331 --> 00:19:36.522
so they're going to be able
to play the game without having that.

00:19:36.546 --> 00:19:38.339
They will be great winners.

00:19:38.363 --> 00:19:40.966
And so there's always new inventions,

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.720
new creativity,

00:19:42.744 --> 00:19:45.228
that is the new adaptation

00:19:45.252 --> 00:19:48.442
that becomes a company
and an entrepreneur.

00:19:48.466 --> 00:19:50.133
And they're going to do great,

00:19:50.157 --> 00:19:52.720
plus the stuff that we're
always going to need.

00:19:52.744 --> 00:19:55.291
Those are the things
that are going to do great.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:57.887
CA: Thank you, Ray.

00:19:57.911 --> 00:19:59.079
Corey.

00:19:59.103 --> 00:20:00.477
CH: Thank you, Chris.